
Module 8: Reporting and Analytics
This module provides business intelligence for the POS system, allowing Administrators and Managers to track performance, identify top products, and understand inventory value.

Proposed Changes
Database Layer
No new tables are required. We will use SQL aggregation functions (SUM, COUNT, GROUP BY) on existing tables: sales, sales_items, products, and payments.

Backend API
[NEW] server/routes/reports.js
Create endpoints restricted to Administrator and Manager roles:

GET /api/reports/summary: Aggregate total revenue and sale counts for today, this week, and this month.
GET /api/reports/top-products: Identify the top 5 best-selling products by quantity.
GET /api/reports/inventory-valuation: Calculate the total value of stock currently on hand (price * quantity).
[MODIFY] server/server.js
Register the new /api/reports routes.

Frontend UI
